{"id":"2257726633","kind":"answer","title":"有没有同时具备 anki 和 notion 功能的软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"知乎问答实战","date":"2021-12-05","updated":"2021-12-05","votes":30,"comment_count":4,"minutes":1,"chars":307,"keywords":["RemNote","间隔重复","知识管理","记忆卡片","概念学习"],"summary":"Notion 的功能可太多了。。。完全覆盖 Notion 功能的笔记软件估计没有。 但是结合 Anki 间隔重复功能的笔记软件还是有的，比如 RemNote、Logseq 等等。 由于我只用过 RemNote，所以就简单介绍一下： 如图所示，RemNote 是一款大纲笔记。 其内置了各种制卡语法，可以让你在写笔记的同时制作抽认…","question_detail_html":"<p>我老的笔记在 anki 中，但显示效果差，插件工作不理想，引用也不方便，更新笔记更麻烦，新的和迁移的不少笔记在 notion 中，但 notion 缺少复盘的功能，导致有的笔记都忘记曾经写过了，还去网上查找。</p><p>有没有一款同时具备 anki 复盘功能，又具备 notion 体验效果的软件？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/503697224/answer/2257726633","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"gfW-Jwl2\">Notion 的功能可太多了。。。完全覆盖 Notion 功能的笔记软件估计没有。</p><p data-pid=\"WlW3HP4A\">但是结合 Anki 间隔重复功能的笔记软件还是有的，比如 RemNote、Logseq 等等。</p><p data-pid=\"Ueps4prR\">由于我只用过 RemNote，所以就简单介绍一下：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7a4af503f71799e53407ea2c3b18a904_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c2eaac8a666b92cce952aa3422f4de97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c2eaac8a666b92cce952aa3422f4de97_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1428\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7a4af503f71799e53407ea2c3b18a904_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-c2eaac8a666b92cce952aa3422f4de97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c2eaac8a666b92cce952aa3422f4de97_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1428\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"-jXmBoHV\">如图所示，RemNote 是一款大纲笔记。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9666e98612f0f817423371143dfc4447_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3abfddc799d866154dee2b5ede306560\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-3abfddc799d866154dee2b5ede306560_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2008\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9666e98612f0f817423371143dfc4447_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-3abfddc799d866154dee2b5ede306560\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-3abfddc799d866154dee2b5ede306560_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2008\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"VbsqzX5A\">其内置了各种制卡语法，可以让你在写笔记的同时制作抽认卡，然后间隔重复。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dcb28a5d7970bc491980552708848130_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d20348aa93c6c5cba9afb9399ce3f145\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d20348aa93c6c5cba9afb9399ce3f145_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2180\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-dcb28a5d7970bc491980552708848130_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-d20348aa93c6c5cba9afb9399ce3f145\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d20348aa93c6c5cba9afb9399ce3f145_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2180\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"D3_ZVN3O\">另外 RemNote 支持双向链接，这一点在数学上特别有用：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f58d99ff883e24bc13920c16180e78ea_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a3e451dd38933795ca94c0eb72d9cea3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a3e451dd38933795ca94c0eb72d9cea3_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2412\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f58d99ff883e24bc13920c16180e78ea_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a3e451dd38933795ca94c0eb72d9cea3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a3e451dd38933795ca94c0eb72d9cea3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2412\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"moP5cWrq\">更多有关 RemNote 的内容，我推荐阅读：</p><p data-pid=\"SWZJDhYL\"><a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"6fd40f6ff16c5f4f3f46871d3d9ea801\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$6fd40f6ff16c5f4f3f46871d3d9ea801\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/6fd40f6ff16c5f4f3f46871d3d9ea801\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@何问宇</a> 的 RemNote 教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0fb9403be0e09cc63ddd0c6dad9f5bff_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"411\" data-image-width=\"999\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/350209298\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">何问宇：结构化突击学习的利器--RemNote, 吹爆!</a><p data-pid=\"Vae4StXz\">我的简单官方教程翻译：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-69332e1ed99be3e7652a24950ca087e5_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"849\" data-image-width=\"1454\" data-tm-id=\"235834139\" href=\"#/post/235834139\">叶峻峣：5 分钟了解 Remnote</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"235834139","title":"5 分钟了解 Remnote","author":"RemNote","votes":39,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"242322075","title":"在 RemNote 中构建知识","author":"RemNote","votes":33,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · RemNote"},{"id":"238333440","title":"Rem 引用","author":"RemNote","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"延伸深读 · RemNote"},{"id":"238211772","title":"迅速组织层次结构","author":"RemNote","votes":11